OL,3,GNEWSA'Motherhood doesn't have to stop
OL,4,Ayour ambitions'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorgie Brayshaw won a gold medal at
OL,7,Fthe Paris Olympics in 2024 as part of
OL,8,FTeam GB's women's quadruple sculls.
OL,10,FShe has now set her sights on returning
OL,11,Fto the Olympic podium in Los Angeles in
OL,12,F2028, this time as a mother of twins.
OL,14,F"It would be amazing to get a gold
OL,15,Fmedal and put it round my children's
OL,16,Fnecks."
OL,18,FGeorgie, who is based in Wallingford,
OL,19,FOXfordshire, gave birth to her twin
OL,20,Fsons in August last year.
